> Termplate File Manager: two directory panels in the style of Midnight
> Commander. The logic lives in fm.sh; this file only describes the UI.
>
>   termplate run examples/filemanager/app.termplate
>
> The base key context is MENU, so the panels' own contexts (LEFT_PANEL,
> RIGHT_PANEL) fall through to the default menu keys for moving around.

app FILEMANAGER
- termplate 0.1
- layout MAIN
- language en
- keys MENU

include ui/*
include text/*
